### SCENARIO: Employee cancels their own pending request
### Prerequisites: run 01-seed-balances.http first

### Step 1: Create a request
POST http://localhost:3000/requests
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "employeeId": "emp-2",
  "locationId": "loc-nyc",
  "policyType": "VACATION",
  "startDate": "2026-07-01",
  "endDate": "2026-07-05",
  "days": 3,
  "reason": "Trip planned",
  "idempotencyKey": "cancel-pending-001"
}

### Step 2: Employee cancels before approval (replace REQUEST_ID)
# Expected: 200 CANCELLED, pending hold released
PATCH http://localhost:3000/requests/{{REQUEST_ID}}/cancel

### Step 3: Verify balance — pending released
GET http://localhost:3000/balances/emp-2/loc-nyc
